# Local scratch from the prototype design migration. These are working
# artifacts, not sources: tmp/ holds one-off analysis scripts and a 193M
# release worktree, and the two prototype dirs are copies of the tracked
# source in .codex-vdeploy-20260824/ui-ux-audit-prototype/. Ignored so
# git status stays readable and none of it is committed by accident.
